# Global Git ignore — OS and editor cruft only.
#
# Deliberately minimal. Anything project-specific (build output, deps,
# artifacts) belongs in that project's own .gitignore: patterns here apply to
# every repo on the machine and silently skip files with no explanation, which
# is very hard to debug when it hits something you meant to commit.

# macOS
.DS_Store
._*

# Windows
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
Desktop.ini
$RECYCLE.BIN/

# Linux
*~

# Editors
*.swp
*.swo
.idea/
.vscode/
*.sublime-workspace
